('medical-lab-technologist', 'kesehatan', 'Kesehatan', 'Healthcare', 'Analis Laboratorium Medis (ATLM)', 'Medical and Clinical Laboratory Technologist', 'Menganalisis sampel darah, cairan tubuh, dan jaringan sel menggunakan mikroskop dan spektrofotometer untuk membantu dokter menegakkan diagnosis.', 'Performs complex chemical, biological, and hematological testing on body specimens to detect medical conditions.', 5000000, 14000000, 'D3/D4 Analis Kesehatan / Teknologi Laboratorium Medis (TLM)', 'Bachelor/Associate of Medical Laboratory Sciences + Technologist License', '["Flebotomi (Pengambilan Darah)","Analisis Darah & Hematologi","Mikrobiologi & Kultur Bakteri","Quality Control Laboratorium","Operasional Analyzer Otomatis"]'::jsonb, '["Phlebotomy","Clinical Hematology Testing","Microbiology & Cultures","Laboratory Quality Control","Automated Bio-analyzers"]'::jsonb, 'Laboratorium klinik independen (Prodia/Kimia Farma), laboratorium patologi rumah sakit, balai laboratorium kesehatan (BLK).', 'Clinical pathology laboratories, hospital diagnostic units, public health testing facilities.', 'Analis Laboratorium -> Penanggung Jawab Teknis Laboratorium -> Manajer Mutu Laboratorium -> Konsultan Riset Diagnostik', 'Lab Technologist -> Technical Supervisor -> Quality Assurance Director -> Diagnostic Research Associate', 'high', 4, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1579154204601-01588f351e67?q=80&w=800&auto=format&fit=crop', false, '[{"code":"ISTJ","match_score":97,"reason_id":"Ketelitian mutlak menguji sampel tanpa kontaminasi dan kepatuhan prosedur baku.","reason_en":"Zero tolerance for sample contamination and rigorous consistency under the microscope."},{"code":"INTP","match_score":92,"reason_id":"Kecermatan menelaah struktur morfologi sel darah aneh di bawah lensa mikroskop.","reason_en":"Sharp pattern recognition identifying rare abnormal cellular morphology under lenses."},{"code":"ISFJ","match_score":89,"reason_id":"Kelembutan tangan saat melakukan flebotomi agar jar